# Local dev: Portless and agent-browser

- Run the apps with `pnpm dev:portless`: marketing at `https://permdock.localhost`, docs at `https://permdock.localhost/docs` (served by `https://docs.permdock.localhost`).
- Run `pnpm exec portless list` first and reuse a running PermDock route.
- The Portless proxy is shared with other repositories. Never stop the proxy, run `portless clean` or `portless prune`, or kill a process you did not start.
- Check UI and routing changes with `agent-browser` on the Portless URL, at 390 px and 1440 px, and show the screenshot.
- Details and the fixes agents needed before: `docs/agents/portless.md` and `docs/agents/agent-browser.md`.
